    "background_0001": "/replica-assets/06d9c766e87f34d82115.png",
    "text_0002": "\n      \n        True Assestment\n      \n    ",
    "text_0003": "Do you feel stuck, disconnected, unmotivated, or spinning in familiar struggles despite your best efforts? You could be living far outside of your ",
    "text_0004": "t",
    "text_0005": "rue life.",
    "text_0006": "The True Life Assessment helps to identify how connected you are to yourself and how satisfied you are with your life today. ",
    "text_0007": "Identifying specific areas of low life satisfaction opens the door to aligning",
    "text_0008": " what you do with who you are — and ",
    "text_0009": "what you truly want.",
    "text_0010": "—",
    "text_0011": "Set aside a few minutes without distractions to take this assessment. Answer the questions based on your first instinct and your own opinions and feelings. If you feel stuck on a question, it may help to skip it and return to that question later.",
    "text_0012": "Know that your information is kept confidential and will never be shared with others.",
    "text_0013": "When you have completed the assessment, enter your email and submit. Don't forget to check your inbox for the results!",
    "text_0014": "Instructions:",
    "text_0015": "After reading each question below, rate your satisfaction level using a scale from 1 to 5. ",
    "text_0016": "Note that the number 5 represents \"highly satisfied\" and number 1 represents \"not at all.\"",
    "text_0017": "How satisfied are you with your home life?",
    "text_0018": "1",
    "text_0019": "2",
    "text_0020": "3",
    "text_0021": "4",
    "text_0022": "5",
    "text_0023": "How satisfied are you with your work and career?",
    "text_0024": "1",
    "text_0025": "2",
    "text_0026": "3",
    "text_0027": "4",
    "text_0028": "5",
